  "description": "The text 'size doesn't matter to me lol' is a common phrase used to dismiss or justify mocking someone's physical appearance, which can be seen as a form of body shaming or objectification. This concept is outside the image and requires real-world knowledge to understand the meme's intent to trivialize the experience of being laughed at for physical appearance.",
